{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1993","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Question Marks"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Tim is doing a test consisting of $$$4n$$$ questions; each question has $$$4$$$ options: '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'. For each option, there are exactly $$$n$$$ correct answers corresponding to that option — meaning there are $$$n$$$ questions with the answer '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', $$$n$$$ questions with the answer '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', $$$n$$$ questions with the answer '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', and $$$n$$$ questions with the answer '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each question, Tim wrote his answer on the answer sheet. If he could not figure out the answer, he would leave a question mark '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' for that question."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given his answer sheet of $$$4n$$$ characters. What is the maximum number of correct answers Tim can get?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 1000$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains an integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 100$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains a string $$$s$$$ of $$$4n$$$ characters ($$$s_i \\in \\{\\texttt{A}, \\texttt{B}, \\texttt{C}, \\texttt{D}, \\texttt{?}\\}$$$) — Tim's answers for the questions."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print a single integer — the maximum score that Tim can achieve."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n1\nABCD\n2\nAAAAAAAA\n2\nAAAABBBB\n2\n????????\n3\nABCABCABCABC\n5\nACADC??ACAC?DCAABC?C\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n2\n4\n0\n9\n13\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, there is exactly one question with each answer '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'; so it's possible that Tim gets all his answers correct."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, there are only two correct answers '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' which makes him get exactly $$$2$$$ points in any case."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test case, Tim can get at most $$$2$$$ correct answers with option '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and $$$2$$$ correct answers with option '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'. For example, he would get $$$4$$$ points if the answers were '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"AACCBBDD"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fourth test case, he refuses to answer any question at all, which makes him get $$$0$$$ points."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1993A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1993/problem/A"}